  <p>Pre-season maintenance is the insurance policy for this setup. Camera calibration, ejector testing, and belt and lighting checks should be completed before the season starts, and stock of critical spare parts should be prepared in advance — because the most expensive downtime is an unplanned stop in the middle of the season. For maintenance and spare parts planning, see our <a href="/en/service-spare-parts/">service and spare parts page</a>.</p>

